# Redacted run artifacts written by scripts/publish_run.py are committed; the scratch runs above stay ignored.
# No rule above ignores these folders, so the two lines below only document the intent;
# `make eval-publish-run` is what refuses a published folder that was not packed and verified.
!evals/ab/published/
!evals/trigger-live/published/
